stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Ingested
    Ingested --> GeometryComplete: geometry succeeds
    GeometryComplete --> TemplateHypothesesReady: classification succeeds
    TemplateHypothesesReady --> InitialObservationsReady: zones and extraction succeed
    InitialObservationsReady --> CandidatesReady: retrieval succeeds
    CandidatesReady --> DiscriminatorRequested: useful evidence action exists
    DiscriminatorRequested --> CandidatesReady: bounded reread completes
    CandidatesReady --> EvidenceFused: comparison completes
    EvidenceFused --> Decided: policy evaluates
    Decided --> ReviewRequired: policy routes review
    Decided --> InventoryProjected: eligible projection
    ReviewRequired --> Reviewed: disposition appended
    Reviewed --> InventoryProjected: effective state projected
    Ingested --> FailedQualified: input failure
    GeometryComplete --> FailedQualified: perception failure
    TemplateHypothesesReady --> FailedQualified: observation failure
    InitialObservationsReady --> FailedQualified: reasoning failure
    InventoryProjected --> [*]
    FailedQualified --> [*]
